      "bio": "Arun Patrick D'Silva, an Engineer and Musician, brings his dynamic energy to TEDxBistupur as the Master of Ceremony. With his versatile background and charismatic presence, he will skillfully connect the 15 dots represented by the diverse lineup of speakers at the event. As an Engineer, Arun brings analytical thinking and problem-solving skills to the table, ensuring smooth coordination and execution of the event. His passion for music adds an extra dimension to his hosting style, infusing the event with rhythm and harmony. Arun's ability to engage and connect with the audience will set the stage for an inspiring and memorable TEDxBistupur experience, where each dot on the journey contributes to a vibrant tapestry of ideas and insights.",
