        "name": "Amit Gaur",
        "role": "Founder and Healer, Core healing India",
        "bio": "From a thriving career in IT to a transformative journey in healing, Amit Gaur's path has been one of continuous evolution. An Electronics & Communication Engineer with an MBA in Telecom, he spent nearly a decade in the corporate world before embracing spirituality and holistic wellness. In 2012, he founded Core Healing India and dedicated his life to guiding individuals toward inner peace through the power of forgiveness.\n\nAt TEDxBistupur, Amit shared his profound insights on \"Forgiveness as a Therapy,\" emphasizing how letting go of past grievances can be the key to restoring joy, mental clarity, and emotional well-being. With over a decade of experience, he has worked with people from all walks of life—students, artists, CEOs, government officials, and even seasoned healers—helping them unlock the transformative potential of forgiveness.",
